# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DELIBERATE EXCEPTION to the upstream Laravel skeleton: /public/build is NOT
# ignored.
#
# Spec §96 requires deployment on cPanel shared hosting, which typically has no
# Node.js. Assets are therefore compiled in CI (or locally) and the output is
# committed so a `git pull` deploy works with PHP alone (ADR-13).
#
# Cost: build artefacts add diff noise on releases.
# Benefit: production needs no Node, and the deployed asset set is reviewable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# /public/build

# Backups must never be committed (§97) — they live outside the webroot.
/backups
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.sqlite

# PHPUnit JUnit log written by CI for per-test failure reporting
junit.xml
